		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>voici ma situation :</p><p>j&#039;ai une table avec la structure suivante :</p><p>table1 :</p><ul><li><p><ins><strong>|&#160; &#160;ID&#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160;REF&#160; &#160;|</strong></ins></p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 1&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 2&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; A;B&#160; &#160;|</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 3&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; A;B&#160; &#160;|</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 4&#160; &#160; |&#160; A;B;C |</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 5&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 6&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160;C&#160; &#160; &#160;|</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 7&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160;B;C&#160; &#160; |</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 8&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; B&#160; &#160; |</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 9&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160;10&#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; A;B&#160; &#160;|</p></li></ul><br /><p>et je souhaiterai obtenir le résultat suivant :</p><br /><p><span class="bbu">vue1</span> :</p><ul><li><p><ins><strong>|&#160; &#160;ID&#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160;REF&#160; &#160;|</strong></ins></p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 2&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; A&#160; &#160; &#160;|</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 2&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; B&#160; &#160; &#160;|</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 3&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; A&#160; &#160; &#160;|</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 3&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; B&#160; &#160; &#160;|</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 4&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; A&#160; &#160; &#160;|</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 4&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; B&#160; &#160; &#160;|</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 7&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; B&#160; &#160; &#160;|</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 8&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; B&#160; &#160; &#160;|</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160;10&#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; A&#160; &#160; &#160;|</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160;10&#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; B&#160; &#160; &#160;|</p></li></ul><br /><p><span class="bbu">vue2</span> :</p><ul><li><p><ins><strong>|&#160; &#160;ID&#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160;REF&#160; &#160;|</strong></ins></p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 4&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; C&#160; &#160; &#160;|</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 6&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; C&#160; &#160; &#160;|</p></li><li><p>|&#160; &#160; 7&#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; C&#160; &#160; &#160;|</p></li></ul><br /><p>Et je n&#039;y arrive pas ! Je m&#039;embourbe depuis 3 jours dans les erreurs de syntaxe avec les CREATE VIEW, les LOOP et les IF ! !</p><p>Si quelqu&#039;un a une idée..... je le remercie d&#039;avance.</p>]]></content>
